+// vectors and no camera jitter. The convert pass is therefore skipped - its
+// output would be zero motion and zero depth clip everywhere - and those values
+// are folded in here. With zero motion SGSR2 keeps a history that is clamped
+// to the current neighbourhood every frame, which stabilises shimmering edges
+// without ghosting, on top of its Lanczos upsampling.
+//
+// Regenerate the header with:
+//   glslangValidator -V --vn guest_output_sgsr2_ps -o ../vulkan_spirv/guest_output_sgsr2_ps.h guest_output_sgsr2_ps.frag
